 trauma, stroke, and acute abdominal cases can be scanned within minutes of triage. Outpatients are seen by appointment or walk-in, with most plain studies completed in under thirty minutes.","All studies are interpreted by a licensed radiologist. Reports for studies done before 2 PM are released the same day; emergency studies are read on call, twenty-four hours."]},"procedures":[{"icon":"radiology","title":"Digital X-ray","detail":"Chest, skull, spine, extremities"},{"icon":"monitor_heart","title":"16-slice CT scan","detail":"Head, chest, abdomen, spine; with or without contrast"},{"icon":"pregnant_woman","title":"Ultrasound","detail":"Prenatal, whole abdomen, KUB, thyroid, breast"},{"icon":"cardiology","title":"ECG & 2D-echo","detail":"Resting ECG daily; 2D-echo Tue & Fri"}],"preparation":["Bring a physician's request — required for every study.","Fast for six hours before an abdominal ultrasound or a contrast CT.","For pelvic ultrasound, drink water and keep a full bladder.","Tell the technologist if you are pregnant or allergic to contrast dye.","Bring any previous imaging results for comparison."],"schedule":[{"icon":"schedule","text":"Outpatient: daily 8 AM – 5 PM"},{"icon":"emergency","text":"Emergency studies: 24/7 on call"},{"icon":"meeting_room","text":"Ground floor, beside the ER"},{"icon":"call","text":"(032) 484 1200 local 112"}],"staff":[{"name":"Dr. Edgar P. Pacaña","role":"Radiologist","initials":"EP"},{"name":"Jomar L. Tabada, RRT","role":"Chief Radiologic Technologist","initials":"JL"}],"emergencyTitle":"Emergency imaging","gallery":[{"src":"/api/media/file/imaging-1.webp","alt":"CT suite"},{"src":"/api/media/file/ultrasound-1.webp","alt":"Ultrasound room"},{"src":"/api/media/file/cath-lab-1.webp","alt":"Procedure room"}]}},{"slug":"laboratory","name":"Clinical Laboratory","icon":"labs","summary":"Hematology, blood chemistry, urinalysis, drug testing, and pre-employment panels.","summaryShort":"Open 24/7","image":{"src":"/api/media/file/conference-1.webp","alt":"Laboratory"},"categories":["diagnostics"],"categoryLabel":"Diagnostics","tags":[{"label":"Open 24/7","tone":"info"}],"menuName":"Laboratory","menuSummary":"Blood chem, hematology, swab","inMegaMenu":true,"detail":{"lead":"Hematology, blood chemistry, urinalysis, drug testing, and pre-employment panels.","schedule":[{"icon":"schedule","text":"Open 24 hours, walk-in"}]}}]}]}]]
